{
  "$schema": "../../schema/markup.schema.json",
  "version": "1.0.0-rc.9",
  "id": "site-footer",
  "kind": "component",
  "root": {
    "element": "footer",
    "classes": [
      "salt-footer"
    ],
    "attributes": {
      "data-tone": {
        "enum": [
          "surface",
          "surface-alt",
          "brand-tint",
          "surface-inverse"
        ]
      },
      "data-tone-dark": {
        "enum": [
          "surface",
          "surface-alt",
          "brand-tint",
          "surface-inverse"
        ]
      }
    }
  },
  "elements": [
    {
      "role": "inner",
      "element": "div",
      "classes": [
        "salt-footer__inner"
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "role": "brand",
          "element": "div",
          "classes": [
            "salt-footer__brand"
          ],
          "optional": true,
          "when": "the footer shows the logo",
          "children": [
            {
              "role": "logo",
              "component": "site-logo"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "role": "nav",
          "element": "nav",
          "classes": [
            "salt-footer__nav"
          ],
          "attributes": {
            "aria-label": "from:labels.navigation"
          },
          "optional": true,
          "when": "a column has links",
          "children": [
            {
              "role": "column",
              "element": "div",
              "classes": [
                "salt-footer__column"
              ],
              "repeat": {
                "from": "columns with links"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "role": "title",
                  "element": "p",
                  "classes": [
                    "salt-footer__title"
                  ],
                  "attributes": {
                    "id": "site-footer__column-<n>"
                  },
                  "text": "from:column.title",
                  "optional": true,
                  "when": "the column has a title"
                },
                {
                  "role": "links",
                  "element": "ul",
                  "classes": [
                    "salt-footer__links"
                  ],
                  "attributes": {
                    "role": "list",
                    "aria-labelledby": {
                      "value": "site-footer__column-<n>",
                      "when": "the column has a title"
                    },
                    "aria-label": {
                      "value": "from:the footer navigation's name (labels.navigation)",
                      "when": "the column has no title: a single flat menu's list takes the nav's name (SC-006, SC-019)"
                    }
                  },
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "role": "link-item",
                      "element": "li",
                      "repeat": {
                        "from": "column.links"
                      },
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "role": "link",
                          "element": [
                            "a",
                            "span"
                          ],
                          "classes": [
                            "salt-footer__link"
                          ],
                          "attributes": {
                            "href": "from:href",
                            "aria-current": {
                              "value": "page",
                              "when": "current"
                            }
                          },
                          "text": "from:label"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "role": "base",
          "element": "div",
          "classes": [
            "salt-footer__base"
          ],
          "children": [
            {
              "role": "text",
              "component": "rich-text-body",
              "classes": [
                "salt-footer__text"
              ],
              "optional": true,
              "when": "footer text has words",
              "note": "No headings allowed in footer text."
            },
            {
              "role": "social",
              "element": "ul",
              "classes": [
                "salt-footer__social"
              ],
              "attributes": {
                "role": "list",
                "aria-label": "from:labels.social"
              },
              "optional": true,
              "when": "profiles are set",
              "children": [
                {
                  "role": "social-item",
                  "element": "li",
                  "repeat": {
                    "from": "profiles"
                  },
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "role": "social-link",
                      "element": "a",
                      "classes": [
                        "salt-footer__social-link"
                      ],
                      "attributes": {
                        "href": "from:profile url"
                      },
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "role": "social-icon",
                          "component": "icon",
                          "attributes": {
                            "role": "img",
                            "aria-label": "from:profile name"
                          },
                          "optional": true,
                          "when": "a glyph exists for the profile; the name as text otherwise"
                        }
                      ],
                      "text": "from:profile name, when no glyph exists for the profile"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "role": "theme-toggle",
              "element": [
                "button",
                "span"
              ],
              "classes": [
                "salt-theme-toggle"
              ],
              "attributes": {
                "type": {
                  "value": "button",
                  "when": "button form"
                },
                "aria-pressed": {
                  "enum": [
                    "true",
                    "false"
                  ],
                  "when": "button form"
                },
                "aria-label": {
                  "value": "from:labels.theme",
                  "when": "button form"
                },
                "aria-hidden": {
                  "value": "true",
                  "when": "span form, before script mounts the toggle"
                }
              },
              "optional": true,
              "when": "the theme toggle is placed in the footer and named",
              "children": [
                {
                  "role": "theme-glyph",
                  "component": "icon",
                  "attributes": {
                    "data-size": "sm"
                  },
                  "repeat": {
                    "from": "sun, moon",
                    "max": 2
                  },
                  "optional": true,
                  "when": "button form: the glyph for the scheme in force"
                }
              ],
              "note": "As the header's: the empty span[aria-hidden] until script mounts the button with its glyph (SC-019)."
            },
            {
              "role": "display-preferences",
              "component": "display-preferences",
              "optional": true,
              "when": "the site offers display preferences"
            },
            {
              "role": "copyright",
              "element": "p",
              "classes": [
                "salt-footer__copyright"
              ],
              "text": "from:copyright line",
              "optional": true,
              "when": "the site sets an organisation name"
            },
            {
              "role": "consent",
              "element": "div",
              "classes": [
                "salt-footer__consent"
              ],
              "optional": true,
              "when": "the site has a consent mechanism wired",
              "note": "Drawn only when the site has a consent mechanism wired, so that a visitor has something to choose (SC-030): on Salt for WordPress an active WP Consent API plugin (wp_has_consent exists), on Salt for Next.js its own consent store with an integration that needs consent. With none wired nothing non-essential loads, and the footer draws neither the control nor its status line. A fixture's site.consent says one is wired.",
              "children": [
                {
                  "role": "consent-control",
                  "component": "button",
                  "attributes": {
                    "type": "button",
                    "data-style": "secondary",
                    "data-salt-consent-preferences": "",
                    "aria-disabled": {
                      "value": "true",
                      "when": "until script hydrates: always, but beside the open consent panel, which only script opens. No other state says anything of this control"
                    }
                  },
                  "text": "from:labels.preferences",
                  "note": "Drawn aria-disabled=\"true\", never disabled, so it keeps its place in the tab order; script removes the attribute when it hydrates (SC-024)."
                },
                {
                  "role": "consent-announce",
                  "element": "p",
                  "classes": [
                    "salt-sr-only"
                  ],
                  "attributes": {
                    "role": "status",
                    "aria-live": "polite"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "role": "consent-panel",
                  "element": "dialog",
                  "classes": [
                    "salt-consent-panel"
                  ],
                  "attributes": {
                    "open": "",
                    "aria-labelledby": "site-footer__consent-title"
                  },
                  "optional": true,
                  "when": "the visitor opens preferences",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "role": "consent-form",
                      "element": "form",
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "role": "consent-title",
                          "element": "h2",
                          "classes": [
                            "salt-consent-panel__title"
                          ],
                          "attributes": {
                            "id": "site-footer__consent-title"
                          },
                          "text": "from:labels.title"
                        },
                        {
                          "role": "consent-category",
                          "element": "div",
                          "classes": [
                            "salt-consent-panel__category"
                          ],
                          "repeat": {
                            "from": "categories"
                          },
                          "note": "One box per WP Consent API category the site's integrations use, in the API's order (functional, preferences, statistics, statistics-anonymous, marketing), never one per Salt category: <category> is the API category, and ticking the box grants or refuses every Salt category in its group (site-footer's consent ruling, SC-030). So no box shares its setting with another, and the panel draws no note that two do.",
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "role": "consent-checkbox",
                              "element": "input",
                              "classes": [
                                "salt-consent-panel__checkbox"
                              ],
                              "attributes": {
                                "type": "checkbox",
                                "id": "site-footer__consent-<category>",
                                "name": "<category>",
                                "aria-describedby": "site-footer__consent-<category>-description"
                              }
                            },
                            {
                              "role": "consent-label",
                              "element": "label",
                              "attributes": {
                                "for": "site-footer__consent-<category>"
                              },
                              "text": "from:category.label"
                            },
                            {
                              "role": "consent-description",
                              "element": "div",
                              "classes": [
                                "salt-consent-panel__description"
                              ],
                              "attributes": {
                                "id": "site-footer__consent-<category>-description"
                              }
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "role": "consent-actions",
                          "element": "div",
                          "classes": [
                            "salt-consent-panel__actions"
                          ],
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "role": "consent-save",
                              "component": "button",
                              "attributes": {
                                "type": "submit",
                                "data-style": "primary"
                              }
                            },
                            {
                              "role": "consent-cancel",
                              "component": "button",
                              "attributes": {
                                "type": "button",
                                "data-style": "secondary"
                              }
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ],
                  "note": "Drawn only when open, so always with open (SC-019)."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "headings": {
    "provides": "never",
    "level": "none",
    "note": "The consent panel's title is an h2 inside its own dialog, outside the page outline."
  },
  "script": {
    "kind": "progressive",
    "withoutScript": "Footer links and text; the consent control is drawn aria-disabled=\"true\".",
    "withScript": "The consent preferences dialog and the theme toggle."
  },
  "uses": [
    "button",
    "display-preferences",
    "icon",
    "rich-text-body",
    "site-logo"
  ],
  "ruleRefs": [
    "section#landmarks",
    "section#focus-ring",
    "section#target-size",
    "section#sr-only"
  ],
  "hooks": [
    {
      "class": "salt-footer__brand",
      "role": "brand",
      "reason": "Holds the footer logo; laid out by the inner grid."
    },
    {
      "class": "salt-footer__column",
      "role": "column",
      "reason": "Groups a column title with its links."
    },
    {
      "class": "salt-footer__consent",
      "role": "consent",
      "reason": "Holds the consent preferences control and its dialog."
    }
  ],
  "notes": [
    {
      "topic": "stylesheet-owes",
      "text": "From WordPress: the copyright line; no rule yet.",
      "classes": [
        "salt-footer__copyright"
      ]
    },
    {
      "topic": "ruling",
      "text": "Footer links are drawn in columns. A single flat menu, as WordPress has, maps to one untitled column (SC-006): no title paragraph, and its list takes the nav's name."
    },
    {
      "topic": "ruling",
      "text": "The consent panel groups its boxes by WP Consent API category (SC-030). Each Salt category maps to one API category: analytics to statistics, embeds to marketing, marketing to marketing, and a platform's own extra category to the one its platform maps it to (Salt for WordPress's maps to marketing); necessary is never a box. The panel draws one box per API category that at least one of the site's integrations uses, in the API's order (functional, preferences, statistics, statistics-anonymous, marketing). The box's id, name and <category> are the API category; its label and description are the site's. Ticking a box grants every Salt category in its group, and clearing it refuses them all, so a visitor's choice reads the same through the WP Consent API (wp_has_consent) and through Salt's own gate, and no two boxes ever share one setting. A site whose integrations use only analytics draws one box, statistics."
    },
    {
      "topic": "order",
      "text": "Base order: text, social, theme toggle, display preferences, copyright, consent. WordPress today: social, text, copyright, preferences."
    },
    {
      "topic": "ruling",
      "text": "Every id the footer draws is fixed (SC-012), with the footer's own id as its owner, as sections.json names it: the consent panel is drawn by the footer, and the vocabulary has no consent component of its own. A column title is site-footer__column-<n>, <n> its column's position among the columns with links, counting from 1. The consent panel's title is site-footer__consent-title, and each category's checkbox and description are site-footer__consent-<category> and site-footer__consent-<category>-description, <category> the box's WP Consent API category (statistics, marketing). A drawn id contains __, which no anchor can, so none can meet an editor's anchor."
    }
  ],
  "platforms": {
    "nextjs": {
      "owes": [
        "The copyright line (p.salt-footer__copyright) and the display preferences slot.",
        "The column ids site-footer__column-<n>, counting from 1, in place of the salt-footer-column-<n> ones it builds from idPrefix and counts from 0; the idPrefix prop goes (SC-012).",
        "The consent panel's ids site-footer__consent-title, site-footer__consent-<category> and site-footer__consent-<category>-description in place of the useId() prefix it builds them from today (SC-012).",
        "The consent panel's boxes by WP Consent API category (SC-030): one statistics box for analytics and one marketing box for embeds and marketing, named and id'd by the API category, each setting every Salt category in its group, in place of one box per Salt category (analytics, embeds, marketing). The consent cookie keeps Salt's categories.",
        "The consent control and its status line drawn only when its consent store is wired to an integration that needs consent (SC-030)."
      ]
    },
    "wordpress": {
      "formerly": [
        {
          "role": "root",
          "element": "footer",
          "classes": [
            "x-footer",
            "border-t",
            "bg-surface-alt"
          ]
        },
        {
          "role": "inner",
          "element": "div",
          "classes": [
            "mx-auto",
            "max-w-7xl"
          ]
        },
        {
          "role": "nav",
          "element": "nav",
          "classes": [
            "x-footer-nav"
          ],
          "attributes": [
            "aria-label=Footer"
          ]
        },
        {
          "role": "links",
          "element": "ul",
          "classes": [
            "x-footer-menu"
          ]
        },
        {
          "role": "social",
          "element": "ul",
          "classes": [
            "x-footer-social"
          ]
        },
        {
          "role": "social-link",
          "element": "a",
          "classes": [
            "x-footer-social-link"
          ],
          "attributes": [
            "rel=noopener"
          ],
          "note": "x-icon plus span.visually-hidden label"
        },
        {
          "role": "text",
          "element": "p",
          "classes": [
            "x-footer-text"
          ]
        },
        {
          "role": "copyright",
          "element": "p",
          "classes": [
            "x-footer-copyright"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "owes": [
        "Rename to salt-footer*; data-tone on the footer; columns, its single menu as one untitled column; the consent control and panel only when a WP Consent API plugin is active (SC-030); social icons named by role=img and aria-label.",
        "The hydrated consent panel's boxes by WP Consent API category (SC-030): one per API category the site's integrations use, named by it, each setting every Salt category salt_consent_api_category maps to it, so the 'Shares one setting with …' note goes.",
        "The column and consent panel ids exactly as the ruling note fixes them (SC-012).",
        "SC-019: the theme toggle's server form is the empty span[aria-hidden] and its button draws the sun or moon glyph; an untitled column's list carries the nav's name as aria-label; the consent panel dialog carries open."
      ]
    }
  }
}
